== Trivia ==
*'''Arthur'''{{'}}s Wheat Minion has a piece of {{Item|Enchanted Bread}} that never runs out.
*'''Arthur''' still claims his Wheat Minion has a {{Item|Compactor}} in it, despite it no longer having one. 
*In {{zone|The Garden}}, '''Arthur''' says {{Dialogue|That should boost my minion to at least Tier 5!}} once completing a trade request, despite his minion already being Tier <code>V</code>.

